cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "FTIR-LDIR-Raman: multi-instrument microplastic particle matching pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Aligns and matches microplastic particles measured on the same filter by
  FTIR (PerkinElmer Spotlight, Bruker LUMOS), Raman (WITec) and LDIR (Agilent
  8700) microspectroscopy, and compares the instruments' material
  identifications at family and exact-polymer level. R pipeline with a Python
  LDIR image backend and a Shiny viewer.
authors:
  - family-names: Moeller
    given-names: Kristof
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/KristofM854/FTIR-LDIR-Raman"
keywords:
  - microplastics
  - FTIR
  - Raman
  - LDIR
  - microspectroscopy
  - point set registration
  - particle matching
